  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-d3HHR79F\" id=\"h346b9f0-d3HHR79F\">视频教程</h1><div data-type=\"video\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%A1%E7%8E%87%E4%BD%8E.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A17892400%2C%22id%22%3A%22MRsy1%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22percent%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Flf3-openapi.byteadverts.com%2Fobj%2Fopen-api-file-public%2F7bc68395e2815ece019a5c20ab744ffb%22%2C%22naturalWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22naturalHeight%22%3A940%2C%22width%22%3A853%2C%22height%22%3A418%7D\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"qz-video-contain\"><video controls=\"\" src=\"https://lf3-openapi.byteadverts.com/obj/open-api-file-public/7bc68395e2815ece019a5c20ab744ffb\" webkit-playsinline=\"webkit-playsinline\" playsinline=\"playsinline\" style=\"outline:none;\" widht=\"853\" height=\"418\"></video></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-upeeFGT9\" id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-y5LGQSyE\">代理商场景会会关注账户过审情况，通过脚本可以实现定时监控账户整体健康情况，异常情况推送到群聊报警</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-9bzh20pT\" id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZgRUQijb\">通过创建一个定时的脚本，定时拉取代理商账户下所有adv账户的广告列表数据，统计：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-m3i3NMXk\">拒审率 = T-1天创建的拒审广告总数/T-1天创建的广告总数（不含已删除）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-9j778Ajd\">汇总完毕后，取拒审小于95%的，TOP50账户的向企业IM群（如飞书群）发送通知</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E6%9A%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%2F%E6%98%9F%E5%9B%BE%2F%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%8E%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%2C%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8FAD%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%5Cn%20*%20%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7T-1%E5%A4%A9%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%A1%E6%A0%B8%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E7%8E%87%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%8Ethreshold%E7%9A%84adv%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%200.%20%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%5Cnlet%20CONFIG%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20threshold%3A%2095%2C%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BF%87%E5%AE%A1%E7%8E%87%5Cn%20%20webHookURL%3A%20''%2C%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7https%3A%2F%2Fopen.feishu.cn%2Fdocument%2Fclient-docs%2Fbot-v3%2Fadd-custom-bot%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20webhook%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E8%87%B3%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%5Cn%20%20companyIDs%3A%20%5B%5D%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%5B123321%2C%20456654%5D%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20checkConfig()%3B%5Cn%20%20console.log('%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B')%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20card_info%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%201.%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8F%AF%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%5Cn%20%20const%20agents%20%3D%20await%20Mapi.getAgents()%3B%5Cn%20%20if%20(agents.length%20%3D%3D%3D%200)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20console.log('%E6%97%A0%E5%8F%AF%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7')%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%3B%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20let%20agent%20%3D%20agents%5B0%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20last_day%20%3D%20getPreviousDate()%3B%5Cn%20%20console.log('%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%9A'%2C%20agent)%3B%5Cn%20%20await%20agent%5Cn%20%20%20%20.advSelector()%5Cn%20%20%20%20.withCompanyIds(CONFIG.companyIDs)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%98%A8%E5%A4%A9%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8E100%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%